    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>publisher</code></a> emitting the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/ValueExpressionEvaluator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ValueExpressionEvaluator</code></a> suitable to evaluate expressions\nbacked by the given dependencies.",
